<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>Item 7.01 Regulation FD Disclosure. </b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">On May 22, 2026, the Company issued a press release
titled, &#8220;Sadot Group Announces 1-for-20 Reverse Stock Split.&#8221; A copy of the press release is attached hereto as Exhibit 99.1.</p>

